{%- comment -%}
  main-wishlist — the saved list.

  New in v3. Live had no real wishlist page: templates/search.wishlist.liquid
  ran a SEARCH for the product ids T4S kept in the browser, so the "wishlist"
  was a search results page wearing a different heading. Nothing was stored
  against a customer, and nothing is here either — Ed, 01/09/2026: device
  only, no account, and it exists so partners can send each other rings.

  ── WHY THE GRID IS EMPTY IN THIS FILE ────────────────────────────────────

  Because the list lives in localStorage, which Liquid cannot see. The server
  has no idea what this shopper saved, so the section renders the furniture —
  heading, share bar, enquiry, empty state — and assets/fye-wishlist.js fills
  the grid on load.

  WITHOUT JAVASCRIPT this page shows the empty state. That is not a graceful
  degradation so much as an honest one: there is no server-side list to fall
  back to, and pretending otherwise would mean showing a shopper someone
  else's rings. The empty copy is written so it reads sensibly either way.

  ── PRICES ARE READ LIVE ──────────────────────────────────────────────────

  Never from the saved copy. A ring saved in March and opened in September
  must not quote March's price; metal moves, and a stale figure in a list
  shared with a partner is a promise we did not make. See fye-wishlist.js for
  what is fetched and what the one honest limitation is.

  ── SHARING ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

  The whole list is encoded into the URL, because there is nowhere else to put
  it: no account, no metaobject, nothing server-side. A shortlist of three or
  four configured rings makes a long link — fine for WhatsApp and email, ugly
  read aloud. Ed knows; short links would need somewhere to store the list.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign s = section.settings
  assign band = s.band | default: 'white'
-%}

<section class="fye-wish band band--{{ band }}"
         data-screen-label="Wishlist"
         data-fye-wishlist
         data-enquiry-url="{{ s.enquiry_url }}">
  <div class="wrap">

    {%- comment -%}
      Everything below is hidden until the script knows which state applies, so
      the page cannot flash an empty message at somebody who has ten rings
      saved. The script removes `hidden` from exactly one of them.
    {%- endcomment -%}

    <div class="wish-page__head">
      <div class="wish-page__headings">
        {%- if s.eyebrow != blank -%}
          <p class="eyebrow">{{ s.eyebrow }}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <h1 class="wish-page__title">{{ s.heading | default: 'Your saved rings' }}</h1>
        <p class="lead wish-page__count" data-wish-summary hidden></p>
      </div>

      <div class="wish-page__tools" data-wish-tools hidden>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn--outline" data-wish-share="copy">
          <span>Copy link</span>
        </button>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" data-wish-share="whatsapp" href="#" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <span>WhatsApp</span>
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" data-wish-share="email" href="#">
          <span>Email</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- if s.share_note != blank -%}
      <p class="fine wish-page__note" data-wish-tools hidden>{{ s.share_note }}</p>
    {%- endif -%}

    <div class="wish-page__grid" data-wish-grid hidden></div>

    <div class="wish-page__foot" data-wish-tools hidden>
      {%- if s.enquiry_url != blank -%}
        <a class="btn" href="{{ s.enquiry_url }}" data-wish-enquire>
          {{ s.enquiry_label | default: 'Ask us about these' }}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}
      <button type="button" class="wish-page__clear" data-wish-clear>Clear the list</button>
    </div>

    <div class="wish-page__empty" data-wish-empty hidden>
      <h2 class="wish-page__emptyhead">{{ s.empty_heading | default: 'Nothing saved yet' }}</h2>
      {%- if s.empty_copy != blank -%}
        <p class="lead wish-page__emptycopy">{{ s.empty_copy }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
      <a class="btn" href="{{ s.empty_link | default: '/collections/all' }}">
        {{ s.empty_label | default: 'Start browsing' }}
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%}
  Page-only. The store lives in fye-ui.js because the hearts are on every page;
  only this page needs the renderer, the share encoding and the price fetches.
  No defer: the script waits for the store itself, so load order cannot leave
  the grid blank again.
{%- endcomment -%}
<script src="{{ 'fye-wishlist.js' | asset_url }}"></script>

{% stylesheet %}
.fye .wish-page__head {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: flex-end;
  gap: var(--s6);
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  padding-bottom: var(--s6);
  border-bottom: var(--hairline);
}
.fye .wish-page__headings { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s2); }
.fye .wish-page__title { margin: 0; }
.fye .wish-page__count { margin: 0; }
.fye .wish-page__tools { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--s3); }
.fye .wish-page__tools .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--s2); }
.fye .wish-page__note { margin: var(--s4) 0 0; }

.fye .wish-page__grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(260px, 1fr));
  gap: var(--s8) var(--s6);
  margin-top: var(--s8);
}

/* ---- one saved ring ---------------------------------------------------- */
.fye .wcard { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--s3); }
.fye .wcard__media { position: relative; display: block; }
.fye .wcard__img { width: 100%; aspect-ratio: 1; object-fit: cover; background: var(--ivory); }
.fye .wcard__drop {
  position: absolute;
  top: var(--s3);
  right: var(--s3);
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  background: var(--ivory);
  color: var(--ink);
  border: 0;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.fye .wcard__drop:hover { color: var(--sage); }

.fye .wcard__name { font-size: var(--fs-small); line-height: 1.35; }
.fye .wcard__name:hover { color: var(--sage); }
.fye .wcard__price { margin: 0; font-size: var(--fs-small); font-weight: var(--fw-medium); }

/* The configuration, as a plain list. This is the whole point of saving more
   than a product id, so it is not hidden behind a disclosure. */
.fye .wcard__spec { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-size: var(--fs-fine); color: var(--ink-soft); }
.fye .wcard__spec > li { margin: 0; }
.fye .wcard__spec b { font-weight: var(--fw-medium); }

.fye .wcard__stale { margin: 0; font-size: var(--fs-fine); color: var(--ink-soft); }
.fye .wcard__gone { margin: 0; font-size: var(--fs-fine); }

.fye .wcard__note {
  width: 100%;
  min-height: 44px;
  padding: var(--s3);
  border: var(--hairline);
  background: var(--white);
  font: inherit;
  font-size: var(--fs-fine);
  color: var(--ink);
  resize: vertical;
}
.fye .wcard__note::placeholder { color: var(--ink-soft); }

.fye .wcard__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--s2); margin-top: var(--s1); }

/* ---- foot & empty ------------------------------------------------------ */
.fye .wish-page__foot {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: var(--s5);
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  margin-top: var(--s10);
  padding-top: var(--s6);
  border-top: var(--hairline);
}
.fye .wish-page__clear {
  background: none;
  border: 0;
  padding: 0;
  font: inherit;
  font-size: var(--fs-fine);
  color: var(--ink-soft);
  border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.fye .wish-page__clear:hover { color: var(--sage); }

.fye .wish-page__empty {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  gap: var(--s5);
  text-align: center;
  padding: var(--s10) 0;
}
.fye .wish-page__emptycopy { max-width: 46ch; }

@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .fye .wish-page__head { align-items: flex-start; }
  .fye .wish-page__grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(150px, 1fr)); gap: var(--s6) var(--s4); }
}
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Wishlist",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "header", "content": "Heading" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "SAVED" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Your saved rings" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "share_note",
      "label": "Sharing note",
      "default": "Your list is saved on this device. Share the link to show someone else — they will see exactly what you saved."
    },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Enquiry" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "enquiry_label", "label": "Button label", "default": "Ask us about these" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "enquiry_url", "label": "Contact page" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Empty state" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "empty_heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Nothing saved yet" },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "empty_copy",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "Tap the heart on any ring and it will appear here, exactly as you configured it."
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "empty_label", "label": "Button label", "default": "Start browsing" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "empty_link", "label": "Button link" },

    { "type": "header", "content": "Background" },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "band",
      "label": "Band colour",
      "default": "white",
      "options": [
        { "value": "white", "label": "White" },
        { "value": "ivory", "label": "Ivory" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
